# E2E Testing Rules

Every UI feature must be tested end-to-end. This project ships on **three platforms** — run E2E on all affected platforms.

## Web E2E (Playwright)

**Location:** `web/tests/e2e/<feature>.spec.js`

```bash
cd web && npx playwright test          # headless
cd web && npx playwright test --headed # visible browser
```

Playwright auto-starts `python3 -m http.server 8080` via `webServer` config.

### Required setup pattern

```javascript
test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto('http://localhost:8080');
    await page.waitForSelector('.main-nav', { timeout: 10000 });
    await page.click('#audio-status');
    await page.waitForTimeout(500);
});
```

### Selector preferences (in order)
1. `getByRole` / `getByLabel` / `getByText`
2. `locator('text=...')`
3. CSS class (last resort)

### Waiting — no hard sleeps
Use `expect(locator).toBeVisible()` or `waitForSelector` with timeout.

## Flutter E2E (integration_test)

**Location:** `integration_test/<feature>_test.dart`

```bash
flutter test integration_test/          # all integration tests
flutter test integration_test/foo_test.dart  # single file
```

To run on a device/simulator:
```bash
flutter test integration_test/ -d <device_id>
```

### Required setup pattern

```dart
import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:integration_test/integration_test.dart';
import 'package:swarsadhana/main.dart' as app;

void main() {
  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();

  testWidgets('feature description', (tester) async {
    app.main();
    await tester.pumpAndSettle();
    // ... interact and assert
  });
}
```

### Selector preferences (in order)
1. `find.byKey(Key('...'))` — semantic keys set in widgets
2. `find.text('...')`
3. `find.byType(WidgetType)`

### If `integration_test/` does not exist yet
Create it and add `integration_test` to `dev_dependencies` in `pubspec.yaml`:
```yaml
dev_dependencies:
  integration_test:
    sdk: flutter
```

## Full Verification Checklist

Run after every UI feature (complements cross-platform rule):

```bash
# Web
cd web && npx vitest run && npx playwright test

# Flutter
flutter analyze
flutter test
flutter test integration_test/   # if integration tests exist
flutter build ios --simulator --no-codesign
flutter build apk --debug
```

## When to Write Which

| Change touches…         | Web E2E | Flutter E2E |
|-------------------------|---------|-------------|
| `web/` only             | Yes     | No          |
| `lib/` only             | No      | Yes         |
| Both (feature parity)   | Yes     | Yes         |
| Shared assets only      | Yes     | Yes         |

No feature is complete until its E2E tests pass on all affected platforms.
